//// set: ac-a1 — 参数数组绑定里嵌在运算中的数组值调用（取负 / 乘参数 / 结构与非结构实参 / 子模型 / 相减；方程里的 SKIP）
//// model: A10
function so
input Integer m;
output Real o[m];
algorithm
o := {(k - 1)*2*3.14159/m for k in 1:m};
end so;
model A10
parameter Integer m = 3;
parameter Real phase[m] = -so(m);
end A10;
//// model: A11
function so
input Integer m;
output Real o[m];
algorithm
o := {(k - 1)*2*3.14159/m for k in 1:m};
end so;
model A11
parameter Integer m = 3;
parameter Real x = 1;
parameter Real phase[m] = x * so(m);
end A11;
//// model: A12
function sv
input Real x;
output Real o[3];
algorithm
o := {x, 2*x, 3*x};
end sv;
model A12
parameter Real x = 2;
parameter Real phi[3] = 2 * sv(x);
end A12;
//// model: A13
function sv
input Real x;
output Real o[3];
algorithm
o := {x, 2*x, 3*x};
end sv;
model A13
parameter Real x = 2;
parameter Real phi[3] = sv(x) + {1, 2, 3};
end A13;
//// model: A14
function so
input Integer m;
output Real o[m];
algorithm
o := {(k - 1)*2*3.14159/m for k in 1:m};
end so;
model A14
parameter Integer m = 3;
Real y[m];
equation
y = -so(m) * time;
end A14;
//// model: A15
function sv
input Real x;
output Real o[3];
algorithm
o := {x, 2*x, 3*x};
end sv;
model A15
Real x = time;
Real y[3];
equation
y = 2 * sv(x);
end A15;
//// model: A16
function so
input Integer m;
output Real o[m];
algorithm
o := {(k - 1)*2*3.14159/m for k in 1:m};
end so;
model S
parameter Integer m = 3;
parameter Real phase[m] = -so(m);
end S;
model A16
S s(m = 2);
end A16;
//// model: A17
function so
input Integer m;
output Real o[m];
algorithm
o := {(k - 1)*2*3.14159/m for k in 1:m};
end so;
model A17
parameter Integer m = 3;
parameter Real phase[m] = so(m) - so(m);
end A17;
